From: fix: set initial layer height for PhoshHome bar
Subject: [PATCH] home: set layer-surface height to PHOSH_HOME_BAR_HEIGHT

Without an explicit "height" property, PhoshLayerSurface sends
zwlr_layer_surface_v1.set_size(0, 0) on the first commit.  With
anchor = BOTTOM|LEFT|RIGHT but no TOP anchor, wlroots correctly
rejects height=0 with a protocol error, crashing phosh before it
can display anything.

Set "height" to PHOSH_HOME_BAR_HEIGHT (15 px) so the first commit
sends a valid set_size(0, 15), allowing phoc to reply with a
configure event and phosh to proceed with full initialisation.

Fixes: "height 0 requested without setting top and bottom anchors"

--- a/src/home.c
+++ b/src/home.c
@@ -717,6 +717,7 @@ phosh_home_new (struct zwlr_layer_shell_v1          *layer_shell,
                        "kbd-interactivity", FALSE,
                        "exclusive-zone", PHOSH_HOME_BAR_HEIGHT,
                        "namespace", "phosh home",
+                       "height", (guint) PHOSH_HOME_BAR_HEIGHT,
                        /* drag-surface */
                        "layer-shell-effects", layer_shell_effects,
                        "exclusive", PHOSH_HOME_BAR_HEIGHT,
